    <data key="d0">Buzzvil User Segment Processing Platform Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hFx0EF9KEZU</data>
    <data key="d2">Buzzvil's architecture for user activity log collection, serverless Athena ETL into Gold dataset, and sub-200ms targeted ad segment processing using EKS, RDS, and DynamoDB.</data>
